 "segments": [
  {
   "id": "seg-01",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "I start the new work, but it is not ready for review. Now I understand the client. I write a short note about the server. I ask one question about the draft pull request. I mark as ready one small step at a time. Leo says, \"Do you have a table for two?\" so I answer, \"Could we see the menu?\" The day is busy, but I learn a lot.",
   "tts": "I start the new work, but it is not ready for review. Now I understand the client. I write a short note about the server. I ask one question about the draft pull request. I mark as ready one small step at a time. Leo says, \"Do you have a table for two?\" so I answer, \"Could we see the menu?\" The day is busy, but I learn a lot.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-01.mp3",
   "zh": "我开始做新工作，但还不到评审的时候。现在我理解了客户端。我给服务器写了一条简短的笔记。我问了一个关于草稿拉取请求的问题。我一步一步地标记为可评审。Leo说：\"有两个人的桌位吗？\"于是我回答：\"可以给我们看菜单吗？\"这天很忙，但我学到了很多。",
   "hard": [
    {
     "w": "client",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "客户端，主动向服务器请求服务的程序"
    },
    {
     "w": "server",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "服务器，接收请求并提供数据或功能的程序"
    },
    {
     "w": "Do you have a table for two?",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "有两个人的桌位吗？"
    },
    {
     "w": "Could we see the menu?",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "可以给我们看菜单吗？"
    },
    {
     "w": "draft pull request",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "草稿拉取请求，尚未准备好合并的 PR"
    },
    {
     "w": "mark as ready",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "标记为可评审，表示草稿已经准备完成"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "seg-02",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "We eat at a new restaurant. I ask about the menu. During our chat, Maria says, \"I'm allergic to peanuts.\" I answer, \"Is this dish spicy?\" I ask one question about the API. Leo tells me a story about the endpoint. Today I convert to draft for the first time. I learn about the review status because it is useful. I understand a little more than yesterday.",
   "tts": "We eat at a new restaurant. I ask about the menu. During our chat, Maria says, \"I'm allergic to peanuts.\" I answer, \"Is this dish spicy?\" I ask one question about the A P I. Leo tells me a story about the endpoint. Today I convert to draft for the first time. I learn about the review status because it is useful. I understand a little more than yesterday.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-02.mp3",
   "zh": "我们去了一家新餐厅。我询问了菜单。聊天时，Maria说：\"我对花生过敏。\"我回答：\"这道菜辣吗？\"我问了一个关于应用程序接口的问题。Leo 给我讲了一个关于接口端点的小故事。今天我第一次转换为草稿。我学习评审状态，因为它很有用。我比昨天多懂了一点。",
   "hard": [
    {
     "w": "API",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "应用程序接口，让不同程序按约定互相通信"
    },
    {
     "w": "endpoint",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "接口端点，API 中提供某项功能的具体地址"
    },
    {
     "w": "I'm allergic to peanuts.",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "我对花生过敏。"
    },
    {
     "w": "Is this dish spicy?",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "这道菜辣吗？"
    },
    {
     "w": "convert to draft",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "转换为草稿，把正式 PR 退回准备状态"
    },
    {
     "w": "review status",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "评审状态，显示 PR 当前是否获得批准"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "seg-03",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "Before I leave, I finish one last task. Now I understand the base branch. I write a short note about the compare branch. Leo shows me how to send a request. I receive a response one small step at a time. Leo says, \"Could you pack this to go?\" so I answer, \"Everything was delicious.\" I open a draft pull request. The team can watch it grow.",
   "tts": "Before I leave, I finish one last task. Now I understand the base branch. I write a short note about the compare branch. Leo shows me how to send a request. I receive a response one small step at a time. Leo says, \"Could you pack this to go?\" so I answer, \"Everything was delicious.\" I open a draft pull request. The team can watch it grow.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-03.mp3",
   "zh": "离开前，我完成最后一项任务。现在我理解了基础分支。我给比较分支写了一条简短的笔记。Leo 教我怎样发送请求。我一步一步地接收响应。Leo说：\"可以把这个打包吗？\"于是我回答：\"所有菜都很好吃。\"我开了一个草稿拉取请求。团队可以看着它慢慢成形。",
   "hard": [
    {
     "w": "send a request",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "发送请求，向服务器提出操作或数据需求"
    },
