    },
    {
     "w": "Could you pack this to go?",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "可以把这个打包吗？"
    },
    {
     "w": "Everything was delicious.",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "所有菜都很好吃。"
    },
    {
     "w": "base branch",
